  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financing Strategy 2030 Agenda Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic financing critical for realizing the Sustainable Development Goals is central to the Building a Strategy for Financing the 2030 Agenda Multi-Partner Trust Fund. Looking at earlier models and approaches, the Trust Fund helps partners overcome ongoing structural and systematic weaknesses to make economic and policy progress towards realizing the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development.</narrative>
  </description>
